. Detached services can keep running after every terminal closes. Use Shut down Linux in the menu or notification to stop the whole instance cleanly.&#10;&#10;Keep Linux awake lets work continue with the screen off and uses battery. You control it in the menu. Android can still suspend or end the app; battery settings vary by phone.&#10;&#10;Linux uses your phone's memory and storage. Storage &amp; recovery shows the phone's actual free space. Back up Linux saves your files, accounts, packages and configuration to a file you choose.&#10;&#10;App updates preserve your Linux installation. Uninstalling this app or clearing its Android storage deletes the local installation. Keep backups outside the app before doing either.&#10;&#10;If something breaks, save diagnostics from the menu and note what you were doing. Rescue shell and Previous Linux disks provide recovery options. Diagnostics exclude terminal contents and personal files.&#10;&#10;Linux® is the registered trademark of Linus Torvalds in the U.S. and other countries." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.goblinlinux.sentry" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[50,207][670,1040]" /></node></node></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="android:id/buttonPanel" class="android.widget.ScrollView" package="dev.goblinlinux.sentry" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[50,1040][670,1152]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="dev.goblinlinux.sentry" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selecte